---@field dnssecAware? cloudflare.radar.DnsTopAsesRequestDnssecAwareList Filters results based on DNSSEC (DNS Security Extensions) client awareness.
---@field dnssecE2e? cloudflare.radar.DnsTopAsesRequestDnssecE2eList Filters results based on DNSSEC-validated answers by end-to-end security status.
---@field domain? cloudflare.radar.DnsTopAsesRequestDomainList Filters results by domain name. When set, no other DNS filter may be used — only date filtering (`dateRange`, or `dateStart`/`dateEnd`) is allowed — and the date range cannot exceed 31 days.
---@field format? cloudflare.radar.DnsTopAsesRequestFormat|string Format in which results will be returned.
---@field ipVersion? cloudflare.radar.DnsTopAsesRequestIpVersionList Filters results by IP version (Ipv4 vs. IPv6).
