---@field ipVersion? cloudflare.radar.HttpTimeseriesGroupsHttpProtocolRequestIpVersionList Filters results by IP version (Ipv4 vs. IPv6).
---@field location? cloudflare.radar.HttpTimeseriesGroupsHttpProtocolRequestLocationList Filters results by location. Specify a comma-separated list of alpha-2 codes. Prefix with `-` to exclude locations from results. For example, `-US,PT` excludes results from the US, but includes results from PT.
