---@class cloudflare.radar.ListAnnotationsRequest
---@field asn? number Filters results by Autonomous System. Specify a single Autonomous System Number (ASN) as integer.
---@field bot? string Filters results by bot.
---@field ca? string Filters results by certificate authority.
---@field dataSource? cloudflare.radar.AnnotationsListRequestDataSource|string Filters results by data source.
---@field dateEnd? string End of the date range (inclusive). Alternative to `dateRange`; provide together with `dateStart`.
---@field dateRange? string Filters results by a relative date range ending at the current time. Use `<n>d` for days (up to `364d`) or `<n>w` for weeks (up to `52w`), e.g. `7d`. Append `control` to request the equivalent previous period for comparison: the comparison window is shifted back by the current window's length rounded up to a whole number of weeks, so it keeps the same weekday alignment and does not overlap the current window (e.g. `3dcontrol` covers days -10 to -7, `7dcontrol` covers days -14 to -7, `28dcontrol` covers days -56 to -28, and `10dcontrol` covers days -24 to -14). Mutually exclusive with `dateStart`/`dateEnd`.
---@field dateStart? string Start of the date range (inclusive). Alternative to `dateRange`; provide together with `dateEnd`.
---@field eventType? cloudflare.radar.AnnotationsListRequestEventType|string Filters results by event type. EVENT is a legacy alias for GENERAL.
---@field format? cloudflare.radar.AnnotationsListRequestFormat|string Format in which results will be returned.
---@field geoId? string Filters results by geolocation. Refer to [GeoNames](https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/readme.txt).
---@field limit? number Limits the number of objects returned in the response.
---@field location? string Filters results by location. Specify an alpha-2 location code.
---@field log? string Filters results by certificate log.
---@field offset? number Skips the specified number of objects before fetching the results.
---@field origin? string Filters results by origin.
---@field outageCause? cloudflare.radar.AnnotationsListRequestOutageCause|string Filters results by outage cause.
---@field outageType? cloudflare.radar.AnnotationsListRequestOutageType|string Filters results by outage type.
---@field query? string Filters results by a free-text match on the annotation description, id, or linked entities (location, ASN, origin).
---@field tags? cloudflare.radar.AnnotationsListRequestTagsList Filters results by annotation tag. Matches annotations carrying at least one of the given tags.
---@field tld? string Filters results by top-level domain.

---Unwrapped `result` payload of the Cloudflare v4 response envelope.
