---@field ipVersion? cloudflare.radar.AttacksLayer7TimeseriesGroupsVerticalRequestIpVersionList Filters results by IP version (Ipv4 vs. IPv6).
---@field limitPerGroup? number Limits the number of objects per group to the top items within the specified time range. When item count exceeds the limit, extra items appear grouped under an "other" category. Only supported on high-cardinality dimensions; otherwise the request is rejected. Minimum value is 2.
---@field location? cloudflare.radar.AttacksLayer7TimeseriesGroupsVerticalRequestLocationList Filters results by location. Specify a comma-separated list of alpha-2 codes. Prefix with `-` to exclude locations from results. For example, `-US,PT` excludes results from the US, but includes results from PT.
